--
-- Two things worth knowing about this batch's own data, imported as given:
--   - 12 of the 22 boolean flag columns (israeli, international,
--     arabic, european, greek, meaning_love, style_modern, style_unique,
--     style_soft, style_vintage, easy_in_english, works_internationally)
--     are blank for every single one of the 372 rows — not scattered gaps,
--     the whole column. Since these columns are NOT NULL DEFAULT false,
--     blank imports as false (the column's own default) rather than being
--     left unset — not a confirmed "no", just "not marked yes".
