--     "משמעות השם אינה חד משמעית; נדרש מקור נוסף לאימות" (meaning
--     unclear, needs another source to verify) instead of a real meaning —
--     imported as-is, not replaced with an invented meaning.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

